      <description>&lt;p&gt;Signed in-app updates are now available.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Check for a new version from **Moblift → Check for Updates…**.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Manage automatic update checks in **Settings → General → Updates**.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Moblift asks before downloading and restarting, and waits for active capture sessions and file operations to finish.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your saved apps, flows, screens, and recordings stay in place across updates.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you are upgrading from 0.16.4 or earlier, quit the old app and replace it in Applications once to enable in-app updates.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
